Description: Computes weighted rank-dependent concentration and inequality
    indices with explicit treatment of tied ranks. Implements the relative,
    generalized, modified, Wagstaff-normalized and Erreygers-normalized
    estimators described by O'Donnell et al. (2016)
    <doi:10.1177/1536867X1601600112>. A replicate-weight survey design can
    estimate sampling uncertainty while recomputing fractional ranks for
    every replicate. This is an independently restructured R implementation
    informed by the 'Stata' command distributed under the GPL-3 license.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
